# MD164: jump.pad with the preload fired on the jump's face. jump.csv has the preload ready (+0xc40, grounded,
# rising, fast) on rows 119-126: the stick held down (lean past 0.8) from tick 110 arms it as it turns ready,
# and the stick up at tick 121 (lean past -0.8) fires it. [Preload] is off (PreloadTime 0): the push lasts no
# time, but Untamed still posts the cue (research/untamed-machines.md, MD81d).
sleep 15t
down cross
sleep 40t
stick l -1 0
sleep 30t
stick l 0 0
sleep 25t
stick l 0 1
sleep 11t
stick l 0 -1
sleep 6t
stick l 0 0
sleep 218t
release
sleep 30t
